{
  "id": "per-base-zoom-refetch",
  "measured": "2026-09-02",
  "published": false,
  "source": {
    "kind": "bench",
    "repro": "pnpm --filter @jbrowse/web build, then in products/jbrowse-web: node browser-tests/probe-per-base-refetch.ts --fixture=trio, and node browser-tests/probe-per-base-refetch.ts --fixture=fam --data=~/data/fam",
    "notes": "RenderAlignmentData calls intercepted at rpcManager.call in headless Chrome (1280x800, SwiftShader), counted from the first gesture input until the display went quiet. Stepped zoom is seven zoom-in clicks 200ms apart; fast zoom is a zoomTo per frame over the same seven octaves in ~400ms; pan is a 1600px drag at 40px a frame. trio: the hosted 1000G HG02030 slice, chr1:40,478,000-40,528,000 on hg38 (13,324 reads over 54kb, ~37x). fam: a local P. infestans pacbio CCS BAM, Pinf-1306-Chr.6:1,000,000-1,065,000 (43x, median read 11.9kb), served off ~/data/fam. Both start near 40-50 bp/px, where subPixelBinBp is 16."
  },
